# Editions register — {{ organization }}

Written **by the production process** (publication task) for each published edition. Not edited by
hand. For each series: `<series>/<period>.datapackage.json` (files, hashes, cut-off date),
`<series>/editions.csv` (index), `<series>/evaluations/` (indicators) and `<series>/README.md`.

The published data files live in the publication storage (portal, open data); this folder holds
the metadata and the hashes that prove what was published.
